      "created_at": "2018-11-23T21:07:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>During the end of Oblivaeon's (in Phase 1), can you choose whether Oblivaeon or his shield acts first?</p>\n<p>Both come out during setup, so I'm not sure we can follow the same logic as villain targets acting in the order in which they came out (though, logically, Oblivaeon would predate his shield). There could be a tactical advantage to letting the shield act before Oblivaeon.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:12.993Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
